OL,3,GNEWSASix charged after Epsom 'violent
OL,4,Adisorder'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people, including a 12-year-old
OL,7,Fboy, have been charged in relation to
OL,8,F"violent disorder" in a Surrey town in
OL,9,FApril, police say.
OL,11,FSurrey Police said the charges came as
OL,12,Fpart of its investigation into violent
OL,13,Fdisorder which occurred in Epsom town
OL,14,Fcentre on 15 and 20 April.
OL,16,FA 16-year-old boy from Leatherhead has
OL,17,Fbeen charged with a public order
OL,18,Foffence and a 12-year-old boy from West
OL,19,FEwell has been charged with criminal
OL,20,Fdamage, the force said, adding that
OL,21,Fneither could be named because of their
OL,22,Fage.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
